{"id":4838,"date":"2020-10-04T15:45:07","date_gmt":"2020-10-04T14:45:07","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/?p=4838"},"modified":"2020-10-27T21:29:10","modified_gmt":"2020-10-27T20:29:10","slug":"platformio-5-0-1-ou-se-trouve-le-bouton-upload-file-system-image","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/2020\/10\/04\/platformio-5-0-1-ou-se-trouve-le-bouton-upload-file-system-image\/","title":{"rendered":"PlatformIO 5.0.1 : O\u00f9 se trouve le bouton \u00ab\u00a0Upload File System Image\u00a0\u00bb ?"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Dans l&rsquo;ancienne version il y avait un bouton qui permettait de t\u00e9l\u00e9charger dans un ESP8266 ou ESP32 les fichiers web contenus dans le r\u00e9pertoire \/data du projet.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Or dans la nouvelle version, ce bouton a \u00e9t\u00e9 \u00ab\u00a0oubli\u00e9\u00a0\u00bb !!!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Pour ce faire il suffit d&rsquo;ouvrir un terminal et d&rsquo;y taper manuellement la commande suivante : pio run -t uploadfs<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"783\" height=\"164\" src=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/PFIO_L6.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-4839\" srcset=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/PFIO_L6.png 783w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/PFIO_L6-300x63.png 300w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/PFIO_L6-768x161.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 783px) 100vw, 783px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Si, comme moi, vos fichiers ne fonctionnent pas du premier coup, vous devrez proc\u00e9der \u00e0 plusieurs mises \u00e0 jours.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Il n&rsquo;est pas n\u00e9cessaire de retaper cette commande, il suffit simplement d&rsquo;ouvrir le terminal et d&rsquo;appuyer sur la fl\u00e8che du haut, la commande m\u00e9moris\u00e9e r\u00e9apparaitra !<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Depuis une derni\u00e8re mise \u00e0 jour, nous avons retrouv\u00e9 le bouton !!!<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Il suffit de s\u00e9lectionner votre projet puis d&rsquo;appuyer sur le bouton Plateformio du ruban de gauche. <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Ensuite suivez les \u00e9tapes suivantes :<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"350\" height=\"423\" class=\"wp-image-4843\" style=\"width: 350px;\" src=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/PFIO_fileSys.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/PFIO_fileSys.png 436w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/PFIO_fileSys-248x300.png 248w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 350px) 100vw, 350px\" \/><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">1 s\u00e9lectionnez  le dossier env:esp12e<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">2 d\u00e9roulez le menu Platform<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">3 s\u00e9lectionner enfin le bouton Upload Filesystem image<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Dans l&rsquo;ancienne version il y avait un bouton qui permettait de t\u00e9l\u00e9charger dans un ESP8266 ou ESP32 les fichiers web<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":4,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"colormag_page_container_layout":"default_layout","colormag_page_sidebar_layout":"default_layout","footnotes":""},"categories":[166],"tags":[471,487,486],"class_list":["post-4838","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-microclub","tag-esp32","tag-esp8266","tag-platformio"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4838","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/4"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=4838"}],"version-history":[{"count":2,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4838\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":4844,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4838\/revisions\/4844"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=4838"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=4838"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=4838"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}